  "description": "<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Artisticases, bringing out the art in your tech.</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 17); font-family: 'Amazon Ember', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">Our brand was born after our extensive yet fruitless search for a distinct, unique, and one-of-a-kind iPhone case. We realized that nothing could offer what we were looking for. And we decided that it was not up to others to give us what we were searching for, but it's up to us to create what we envisioned&mdash;a phone case unique to every owner, to each his own.</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>What makes our products unique?</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(15, 17, 17); font-family: 'Amazon Ember', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Every purchase from us is a chance to create a custom case to your style and liking. Our cases are built for customization, allowing you to add personal details and pick the case type and print finish that would resonate most with you.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(15, 17, 17); font-family: 'Amazon Ember', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(15, 17, 17); font-family: 'Amazon Ember', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(15, 17, 17); font-family: 'Amazon Ember', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Get a 10% commission for every sale you bring to Artisticases.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; color: rgb(15, 17, 17); font-family: 'Amazon Ember', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Commission paid with PayPal on a weekly basis.</p>\r\n</div>",
